      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-13T15:50:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Have you checked this is safe and actually useful ? If nobody every runs the loop I\u0027m not sure what good this can do, unless you know ① that this will never actually be used as a looper in the test and ② that this will cause an NPE in the code. The former is fairly difficult to keep as an invariant and the latter is necessarily an implementation detail. It\u0027s not always wrong to do this, but be really sure that\u0027s what you want.",
